-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan\">Iksupan</a> - <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"34008,31592,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (34008, 31592, 10)</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIf you have the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Challenger of the Iks title</a> and are within his spawning area, every time he takes damage from you there's around a 10% chance he teleports you to his trap room located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"34038,31563,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (34038, 31563, 10)</a>. Note that fields also count for the teleport chance, so you can speed up the process and get reliably teleported without killing Atab by running him across <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb%20Rune\">Fire Bombs</a>. After being teleported Atab will fully heal, enabling you to continue the fight. It's important to note that if multiple players with the Challenger of the Iks title are present within the spawn area, they will be teleported together to confront Atab in the trap room.\n</p><p>If you wish to kill Atab but do not want to get teleported, you can position him in the north doorway and stand one square north of him while you kill him.\n</p><p>When Atab yells, \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">FEEL THE WRATH OF PURE ENERGY!!!</span>\", be cautious, for his strongest attack follows.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,223 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Broken Mitmah Necklace\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Broken_Mitmah_Necklace_1c374e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Broken Mitmah Necklace</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Check Mark\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Check_Mark_b3619b.gif\" width=\"12\"/></span></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.40</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"39.738348\" style=\"text-align:center;\">40%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Crystal of the Mitmah\" class